<bookmark branch="hid/HID_INTERFACE_SFXHELP_VIEWSH" id="bm_id3156421" localize="false"/>
<h1 id="hd_id3153116"><link href="text/shared/05/00000002.xhp">Icons in the Documentation</link></h1>
<section id="symbole">
<h2 id="hd_id3154962">Icons in the Documentation</h2>
  <paragraph role="paragraph" id="par_id3146961">There are three icons used to call your attention to additional helpful information.</paragraph>
  <warning id="par_id3156152">The <emph>Important!</emph> icon points out important information regarding data and system security.</warning>
  <note id="par_id3153897">The <emph>Note</emph> icon points out extra information: for example, alternative ways to reach a certain goal.</note>
  <tip id="par_id3154216">The <emph>Tip</emph> icon points out tips for working with the program in a more efficient manner.</tip>
</section>
</body>
